  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCS - North Darfur Emergency Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Response by the CCS following the recent escalation of the situation in North Darfur and wave of displacement of IDPs in Zamzam/ Abu Shouk camp to Tawila. Purpose:- First line response through provision of Group Cash Transfers to local responder groups to support communal kitchens, organize relocation/ evacuation, provide urgent access to hygiene and shelter supplies- Emergency MPCA to support immediate HH level needs. (Feasibility of MPCA activity to be confirmed in light of the tight timeline).Duration: 6 weeks.</narrative>
  </description>
